WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.850
Connect students, courses and marks without repeating each fact.

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:12.432
Store students in students(student_id, name) and test results in results(result_id, student_id, assessment, marks).

00:00:12.432 --> 00:00:16.515
student_id in results refers to the student.

00:00:17.515 --> 00:00:19.150
What does a foreign key do?

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:22.420
A foreign key refers to a row's key in a related table.
